     - `title`: Titles are textual fields with rich semantic content.
     - `category`: Categories often contain semantic information about the type of content or service.
   - **users table**: 
     - `username`: Provides semantic identity information.
     - `email`: Although structured, emails can be used to derive semantic user profiles.
