     - `os`: Operating system names are rich in semantic content.
     - `browser`: Browser names provide semantic context about user environment.
   - **reports table**: 
     - `name`: The name of the report can be semantically rich.
     - `file_path`: Contains semantic information about the location and context of the file.
     - `report_type`: Describes the type of report, rich in semantic meaning.

